// Title: Imports Registry Key From an ADS
// ID: 0b80ade5-6997-4b1d-99a1-71701778ea61
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Oddvar Moe, Sander Wiebing, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-12
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
// Description: Detects the import of a alternate datastream to the registry with regedit.exe.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.command_line like "*_ /i *" or process.command_line like "*_.reg*") and process.command_line regex ":[^ \\\\]") and ((process.executable endswith "\\regedit.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "REGEDIT.EXE"))) and not (((process.command_line like "*_ -e *" or process.command_line like "*_ -a *" or process.command_line like "*_ -c *"))))
